(80, 'd6ba4759-8e40-4c88-8729-c6f32a71bf2d', 'Skyview Hostel', 'skyview-hostel', 10, 'Hauz Khas is a neighbourhood in South Delhi, its heart being the historic Hauz Khas Complex. Well known in mediaeval times, the Hauz Khas village has buildings built around the reservoir. There are remnants of Islamic architecture roughly colored by splotches of urban culture. It is centrally located and offers both rural Hauz Khas Village and urban Hauz Khas Enclave, Market environments. Hauz Khas is surrounded by Green Park, SDA to the west, Gulmohar Park towards the north, Sarvapriya Vihar towards the south and Asiad Village and Siri Fort to the east.', 'Hauz Khas is a neighbourhood in South Delhi, its heart being the historic Hauz Khas Complex.  Well known in mediaeval times, the Hauz Khas village has buildings built around the reservoir. There are remnants of Islamic architecture roughly colored by splotches of urban culture. It is centrally located and offers both rural Hauz Khas Village and urban Hauz Khas Enclave, Market environments. Hauz Khas is surrounded by Green Park, SDA (Sri Aurobindo Marg) to the west, Gulmohar Park (Balbir Saxena M', NULL, 'Delhi', NULL, 'India', 28.6408933, 77.2151633, 2489452021, 'node', NULL, NULL, 'published', 0.00, 0, 0, 'osm', NULL, '2026-07-29 12:09:26', '2026-07-29 13:35:41'),
