(410, '3cd638c3-6627-4f04-ae7e-b37220b420f5', 'Clark’s Inn', 'clark’s-inn', 5, 'Taj Hotels is a chain of luxury hotels and a subsidiary of the Indian Hotels Company Limited, headquartered in Mumbai, India. Incorporated by Jamsetji Tata in 1902, the company is a part of the Tata Group. The company employed over 20,000 people in the year 2010.', 'Taj Hotels is a chain of luxury hotels and a subsidiary of the Indian Hotels Company Limited, headquartered in Mumbai, India. Incorporated by Jamsetji Tata in 1902, the company is a part of the Tata Group. The company employed over 20,000 people in the year 2010.\n\n\n== History ==\n\nJamsetji Tata, founder of the Tata Group, opened the Taj Mahal Palace, a hotel in Mumbai (formerly called Bombay) overlooking the Arabian Sea, on 16 December 1903. It was the first Taj property and the first Taj hotel. ', NULL, 'Delhi', NULL, 'India', 28.5465015, 77.2529270, 6929383886, 'node', NULL, NULL, 'published', 0.00, 0, 0, 'osm', NULL, '2026-07-29 12:09:30', '2026-07-31 17:49:36'),
