(863, 'b6bd6474-4af7-4c59-8bd9-27a4cc4c3011', 'Ero by Family Hotels', 'ero-by-family-hotels', 5, 'Kunaal Roy Kapur is an Indian actor, best known for his roles in Delhi Belly (2011), Yeh Jawaani Hai Deewani (2013) and TVF Tripling (2016–2022).', 'Kunaal Roy Kapur (born 13 February 1979) is an Indian actor, best known for his roles in Delhi Belly (2011), Yeh Jawaani Hai Deewani (2013) and TVF Tripling (2016–2022).\n\n\n== Background and personal life ==\nKunaal comes from a family of mixed Hindu Punjabi and Baghdadi Jewish heritage. His paternal grandfather, Raghupat Roy Kapur (or Raghupat Rai Kapoor), was a film producer. Kunaal\'s father was Kumud Roy Kapur, and his mother, Salome Roy Kapur, is of Baghdadi Jewish descent whose ancestors migr', NULL, 'Delhi', NULL, 'India', 28.6418866, 77.2150316, 13322042902, 'node', NULL, NULL, 'published', 0.00, 0, 0, 'osm', NULL, '2026-07-29 12:09:36', '2026-08-01 12:47:14'),
