(1429, '11a462a8-f1b9-422d-83bd-bf4c76d23382', 'NTR statue', 'ntr-statue', 5, 'Dr. NTR University of Health Sciences (NTRUHS) is a public university in the city of Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh.', 'Dr. NTR University of Health Sciences (NTRUHS) is a public university in the city of Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh.\n\n\n== History ==\nThe university was established as \"University of Health Sciences\" by the Government of Andhra Pradesh and was inaugurated on 9 April 1986 by N. T. Rama Rao, the then-Chief Minister of the state. It started functioning on 1 November 1986 with Rama Rao as the university\'s first chancellor. Following the death of Rama Rao, a directive was issued by the Government of Andhr', 'Kammapalem Road', 'ongole', NULL, 'India', 15.5052149, 80.0548223, 5472628309, 'node', NULL, NULL, 'published', 0.00, 0, 1, 'osm', NULL, '2026-07-31 19:05:18', '2026-08-01 17:26:22'),
