(1516, 'e940c027-f020-4e96-9b88-195ba4925028', 'Katta Maisamma Temple', 'katta-maisamma-temple', 1, 'Katta Maisamma temple is a Hindu temple located at Tank Bund in Hyderabad, Telangana state. Hindus offer prayers to Goddess Katta Maisamma at the temple during the time of the Bonalu festival. Katta Maisamma popularly known as Amma also located at Turkyamjal. People praise her mainly for the purpose of Happiness, peacefulness and prosperity. Enjoy the Miracles of Turkayamjal Katta Maisamma.', 'Wikipedia Context: Hindu temple in Telangana State, India. Katta Maisamma temple is a Hindu temple located at Tank Bund in Hyderabad, Telangana state. Hindus offer prayers to Goddess Katta Maisamma at the temple during the time of the Bonalu festival. Katta Maisamma popularly known as Amma also located at Turkyamjal. People praise her mainly for the purpose of Happiness, peacefulness and prosperity. Enjoy the Miracles of Turkayamjal Katta Maisamma.', NULL, 'Hyderabad', NULL, 'India', 17.4129315, 78.4782789, 727183028, 'node', NULL, NULL, 'published', 0.00, 0, 0, 'osm', NULL, '2026-07-31 20:24:42', '2026-08-01 00:06:30'),
